WEBVTT

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:00.936
(Laughter)

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:03.696
You know what it is -- precaffeination.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.856
(Laughter)

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:09.616
So, Chung has had people
yell at her until she cried,

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.656
including a nine-year-old girl,

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:15.936
who didn't like the whipped cream design
that Chung did on her hot chocolate.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:18.856
So I thanked Chung,

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:22.055
and she thanked me for thanking her.

00:04:22.079 --> 00:04:23.336
I cut it off there.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.776
I didn't want to go
into an infinite thanking loop.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.376
(Laughter)

